    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534270/extras/95efc562340dca25586c838f2d7f5fbd.webp?t=1667252980\" /></div><br><br>BARD HARDER! is a tabletop-inspired visual novel game about saving your friends from the Big Bad Evil Guy by using your strongest weapon: romance! So brush up on your pick-up lines and prepare some sexy tunes\u2026what\u2019s the worst that could happen?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534270/extras/6198d2ea4d326d03eefcd6b65594bde5.avif?t=1667252980\" /></div><br><br><strong>\u2665 MULTIPLE ENDINGS \u2665</strong><br>Unlock different endings and achievements based on how well you flirt!<br>Unique story paths make the game different with each playthrough.<br><br><strong>\u2665 NEW FRIENDS \u2665</strong><br>Make friends with Alden, Nia, and Presley, your three TTRPG buds.<br><br><strong>\u2665 ORIGINAL MUSIC \u2665</strong><br>An original soundtrack crafted for BARD HARDER! Features three magical Bard Songs, written in the three genres of music: Power Ballad, Lullaby, and Polka. <br><br><strong>\u2665 A COMPLETE NARRATIVE EXPERIENCE \u2665 </strong><br>A self-contained, 30 minute story that takes you from rivals to romance.<br><br><strong>\u2665 LOADS OF ORIGINAL ART \u2665</strong><br>NINE unique characters.<br>Hang out with them and flirt with all of them even?? I wouldn\u2019t judge<br><br><strong>\u2665 EAT HOT CHIP, BE GAY \u2665</strong><br>Self-explanatory<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1534270/extras/5ac288d203a100556c091775a1265737.avif?t=1667252980\" /></div>",
